      "text": "Acknowledgement records responder engagement; resolution records a separate outcome. The sources describe configurable missing-ACK fallback paths, response timelines, and product-specific exceptions such as per-user multi-ACK and unresolved-alert reminders. Historical Grafana and GoAlert issue reports identify races and ownership gaps that deserve implementation-level checks. This evidence can guide a crypto-bot alert lifecycle, but it does not establish the behavior of any particular bot, a universal response deadline, or a trading action.",
